WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.001 --> 00:00:05.241
Emily: Good afternoon, you're through to Emily at Holcim. How can I help?

2
00:00:06.630 --> 00:00:14.910
Jamie: Afternoon Emily. I'm after 120 tonnes of 10mm Surface Course for a council road job next Thursday night.

3
00:00:16.823 --> 00:00:25.743
Emily: I can definitely schedule that night delivery for you. With it being a council job, do they have you chasing any strict carbon reduction targets?

4
00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:35.897
Jamie: Yeah, it's a massive pain. It's this some green corridor thing, so we have to prove carbon savings on everything we use.

5
00:00:38.086 --> 00:00:49.806
Emily: We can definitely help make that easier. If you're doing any kerb bedding or drainage work on that stretch, we can supply our ECOPact low-carbon concrete. It cuts carbon by up to 70%.

6
00:00:51.540 --> 00:00:58.632
Jamie: We do have about 300 metres of kerbing to reset, actually. Will it set the same as the normal stuff?

7
00:01:00.102 --> 00:01:13.582
Emily: Exactly the same strength and setting time. We can also swap your sub-base for our recycled aggregates. It meets all the highway specs, and having our carbon saving figures will look brilliant on your handover report.

8
00:01:14.370 --> 00:01:21.879
Jamie: Sounds good. Put the ECOPact stuff and the recycled stone on the quote as well. That'll keep them off my back.
